msgctxt "124"
msgid "(...Looks like I found Izumi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Gotcha, Izumi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "What!? You actually found me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "*sigh* And I was keeping so still, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"You had a great hiding spot, Izumi. That's why it took me so long to find "
"you. Anyway, let's go meet up with the others."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "Well, I found everybody. Did you all enjoy yourselves?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Yeah! I thought we made it pretty tough for you, but I guess not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "I was the very last one. Didn't I do a good job hiding, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "You sure did, Izumi. You were the best."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "(Good one, Uncle Kaz. Thanks for doing that for her.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "(No problem.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Wasn't it fun playing together with everyone? Let's do this again sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "But I promise it won't be any easier!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Heh, I hope not."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Come on everyone, let's go study! See you later, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "(...Looks like I found Izumi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Gotcha, Izumi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "What!? You actually found me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "*sigh* And I was keeping so still, too..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Did you find everyone else yet? Am I the very last one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Not quite, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Oh, okay... Can I help you find the others, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "Now that wouldn't be very fair, would it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "...I guess you're right. Okay then! I'll just wait over there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Did you find everyone else yet? Am I the very last one?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Actually, you're the first."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "What!? *sniffle* But I was trying so hard to be last!  Waaahhh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Hey, now... Is it really worth all those tears?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid "Aw, there goes Izumi..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid "I didn't know that would upset her that much..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid "(Didn't I tell you to find her last, Uncle Kaz? Come on!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid "(Right... Sorry about that.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"Guess what, Izumi? Uncle Kaz said if you stop crying, we can treat "
"ourselves to some ice cream. How's that sound?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Ice cream!? Really!? We can...? I'll do anything for ice cream!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Sure... It's in the freezer. Go ahead, help yourselves."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Yaaaay! Yippee! I love ice cream! C'mon, Eri-chan. Let's go!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid ""
"Guess this taught you a good lesson, huh, Uncle Kaz? At least everything's "
"back to normal."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "You're just happy you got ice cream out of it, Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid ""
"Well, yeah... that definitely helps! Anyway, I'll wait here for Izumi, so "
"you can get back to doing whatever you need to do. Thanks for playing with "
"us, Uncle Kaz!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "You got 3,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "(Now that I know where Izumi is, I can always come back to her later..)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid "(This is a great spot! I hope he finds me last!)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Gotcha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid "(On second thought...)"
msgstr ""

